  "interpretation": "The official electronic table provides a dense 10--100 Msun Pop III terminal-yield grid with source-defined kinetic energies, piston locations, artificial mixing, and fallback. It materially improves zero-metallicity mass coverage, but its free explosion and mixing parameters, missing 8--10 Msun interval, omitted rotation/neutrino wind, non-age-resolved release, inferred-only remnant budget, and unresolved redistribution terms prohibit canonical or production promotion.",
